  "label": "User projected onto the textual material explaining the wordplay pun",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the bottom textual material ('because stressed spelled backwards is desserts mind = blown.') as the recipient of the joke. The user is expected to understand the pun and experience the 'mind = blown' reaction, which is visually represented by the man's serious expression. The text directly addresses the user by implying 'you' are the one who would find this explanation surprising or funny.",
